Description: Devuan dom0 admin package for the Qubes-derived port
 Devuan-oriented dom0 administrative package for this Qubes-derived project.
 It installs the core admin Python stack, dom0 helper tools, default policy,
 auxiliary dom0 scripts, and the first runit service assets needed for a
 Devuan + runit dom0 target.
